I, too, have had good luck with some of the more recent ATI cards,
whereas some of the older/earlier MACH64 variations have caused some
problems.

The following have been tested under RH 7.2 for Alpha on MIATA, and
do fine, including 3D:

ATI PCI Rage 128 16MB
ATI PCI Radeon 32MB
ATI PCI Radeon VE (7000) 32MB
